---
layout: layout.njk
lang: en
collectionPage: true
title: Green Series collections
description: Military, Expeditions, and Frontier Regions — explore the verified collections and published editions of the AETERNUS Green Series.
permalink: /collections/green-series/index.html
---
{% set line = site.greenSeries %}
<div class="collection-hero"><div class="shell collection-hero-inner">
  <p class="kicker light-kicker">AETERNUS · THE GREEN SERIES</p>
  <h1>GREEN</h1>
  <p class="collection-subtitle">{{ line.series.label.en }}</p>
  <p>Military accounts, expeditions and frontier narratives share the Green Series identity. Each collection brings related editions together without changing their book pages or publication status.</p>
  <a class="collection-hero-link" href="/series/gruen/">Explore the full Green Series programme →</a>
</div></div>
<section class="shell international-section" aria-labelledby="collections-heading">
  <div class="collection-section-head"><p class="kicker">Within the series</p><h2 id="collections-heading">Explore the Collections</h2><p>These collections contain existing edition pages. A forthcoming book is identified as such; a collection listing does not imply retail availability.</p></div>
  <div class="collection-grid">
  {% for collection in line.publicCollections %}
    <article class="collection-panel">
      <p class="kicker">{{ collection.books.length + collection.publishedGerman.length }} documented edition{% if collection.books.length + collection.publishedGerman.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}</p>
      <h3>{{ collection.title }}</h3><p>{{ collection.intro }}</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ collection.url }}">Explore the collection →</a>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="collection-paper" aria-labelledby="published-heading"><div class="shell international-section">
  <div class="collection-section-head"><p class="kicker">Verified publication status</p><h2 id="published-heading">Published Green Series editions.</h2><p>Only editions already marked as published in the catalogue appear here. English-language books still in preparation are listed on their collection pages.</p></div>
  <div class="collection-edition-list">
    {% for collection in line.publicCollections %}
      {% for item in collection.publishedGerman %}<article><span class="collection-status">Published · German-language edition · {{ collection.title }}</span><h3><a href="{{ item.url }}" lang="de">{{ item.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ item.author }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ item.url }}" lang="de">View the edition on aeternus-verlag.de ↗</a></article>{% endfor %}
      {% for item in collection.publishedBooks %}<article><span class="collection-status">Published · English-language edition · {{ collection.title }}</span><h3><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h3><p>{{ item.authorName }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ item.url }}">View the edition →</a></article>{% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div></section>
<nav class="shell international-section collection-endnav" aria-label="Green Series navigation"><a class="text-link" href="/series/gruen/">All Green Series books →</a><a class="text-link" href="/series/gruen/historical-background/">Historical background →</a><a class="text-link" href="/series/gruen/chronology/">British campaigns chronology →</a></nav>
